#! saves ending_r0
# Route 0's ending: the "ending_r0" fixture is s2auto's turn-1 autosave of the last stage
# (60 返鄉的遊子, --god party) with the turn counter set to 15 (campaign block +0xc). One
# turn of 自動作戰, then the turn-16 events (克雷布特里 withdraws, ending flag 76 (flag 43 set),
# the closing dialogue), the campaign ends: closing pages, the ending variant's epilogues,
# the record, the staff page (the program exits at frame 27339). Inputs recorded by
# s2auto --oracle-check --record-only.
